   {
    "title": "Civilian Hiring Business Process Re-engineering",
    "description": "Working with a DOD Agency to streamline their Civilian Hiring efforts. Currently the agency is hindered due to their data being kept in separate data silos without the experience necessary to integrate their data. We are building interfaces using C# .Net and Low-Code platforms to their data that will provide greater efficiencies with their applicant pool and hiring efforts along with developing customized data visualization using Tableau that can be utilized across the breath of the Agency. ",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jan 2019 - Present"
   },
   {
    "title": "Financial Readiness Training",
    "description": "Worked with a DOD Agency to build a program that encompassed a training portal for their Financial Readiness needs throughout their organization. Worked as a Scrum Developer to build the training program utilizing C# .net and Outsystems Low-Code platforms. The projected included interfacing with api's on parent systems as well as communicating with various other data sources to identify triggers for the users and their training. Worked closely with the clients throughout the Scrum process to verify and refine if and when needed any requirements and changes as needed. ",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Aug 2018 - Jan 2019"
   }
